{"slug":"/components/team-section","title":"Team Section — Animated React Component — Planes","desc":"The team as a roster of large names divided by hairlines.","html":"<main class=\"min-w-0 py-24\"><section><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1.5 px-4 pb-2 sm:px-8 lg:px-16\"><h1 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] sm:text-3xl\">Team Section</h1><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full bg-foreground/8 px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-semibold text-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lock size-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"11\" x=\"3\" y=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path></svg> Pro</span></div><div class=\"py-10 sm:py-14\"><div class=\"relative flex items-center justify-center bg-background min-h-[60vh] py-12 sm:py-16\"><div class=\"flex w-full justify-center px-4 py-16 sm:px-6\"><section class=\"w-full overflow-x-clip max-w-5xl\"><header class=\"max-w-2xl\"><h2 class=\"text-[clamp(1.75rem,3.5vw,3rem)] leading-[1.05] font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em] text-balance text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100\">A small team that answers its own email</h2><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-[52ch] text-[15px] leading-7 text-pretty text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400\">Six people across five time zones. All of us still talk to customers every week.</p></header><div class=\"relative mt-12\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute top-0 left-0 z-10\" style=\"width:176px;height:220px;opacity:1;transform:none\"><div class=\"relative size-full overflow-hidden bg-zinc-100 shadow-[0_28px_70px_-48px_rgba(15,23,42,0.55)] ring-1 ring-black/5 dark:bg-zinc-900 dark:ring-white/10\"><img src=\"/images/team/maya-chen.webp\" alt=\"\" draggable=\"false\" decoding=\"sync\" clas