tracking-[-0.03em] transition-colors duration-300 text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100\">Jonas Weber</h3><span class=\"shrink-0 text-right transition-opacity duration-300\"><span class=\"block text-[14px] font-medium text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300\">Co-founder, CTO</span><span class=\"block text-[13px] text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400\">Berlin</span></span></div></li><li class=\"border-b border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800\" style=\"opacity:1;transform:none\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 py-5 sm:gap-6\"><h3 class=\"min-w-0 flex-1 truncate text-[clamp(1.375rem,3vw,2.25rem)] leading-tight font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] transition-colors duration-300 text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100\">Elena Novak</h3><span class=\"shrink-0 text-right transition-opacity duration-300\"><span class=\"block text-[14px] font-medium text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300\">Head of design</span><span class=\"block text-[13px] text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400\">Amsterdam</span></span></div></li><li class=\"border-b border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800\" style=\"opacity:1;transform:none\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 py-5 sm:gap-6\"><h3 class=\"min-w-0 flex-1 truncate text-[clamp(1.375rem,3vw,2.25rem)] leading-tight font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] transition-colors duration-300 text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100\">Tomás Herrera</h3><span class=\"shrink-0 text-right transition-opacity duration-300\"><span class=\"block text-[14px] font-medium text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300\">Engineering</span><span class=\"block text-[13px] text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400\">Mexico City</span></span></div></li><li class=\"border-b border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800\" style=\"opacity:1;transform:none\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 py-5 sm:gap-6\"><h3 class=\"min-w-0 flex-1 truncate text-[clamp(1.375rem,3vw,2.25rem)] leading-tight font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] transition-colors duration-300 text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100\">Ada Okafor</h3><span class=\"shrink-0 text-right transition-opaci